  "bodyHtml": "<div id=\"cerfitication-container\" class=\"container-fluid lang_rtl\">\n<h1 id=\"about-top-title\" class=\"h1-1\">CERTIFICATION</h1>\n<div class=\"cf_link_area\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"cerfitication_spacing\"></div>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-7\">\n                <div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-4\">\n                    \t<a href=\"/en/certification#si_1\">\n                        <img src=\"/images/CERTIFICATION/icon/img_01.png\" border=\"0\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"\">\n                    \t<p class=\"cf_link_icon_txt\"></p>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-4\">\n                    \t<a href=\"/en/certification#si_2\">\n                    \t<img src=\"/images/CERTIFICATION/icon/img_02.png\" border=\"0\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"\">\n                    \t<p class=\"cf_link_icon_txt\"></p>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-4\">\n                    \t<a href=\"/en/certification#si_3\">\n                    \t<img src=\"/images/CERTIFICATION/icon/img_03.png\" border=\"0\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"\">\n                    \t<p class=\"cf_link_icon_txt\"></p>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-4\">\n                    \t<a href=\"/en/certification#si_4\">\n                        <img src=\"/images/CERTIFICATION/icon/img_04.png\" border=\"0\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"\">\n                    \t<p class=\"cf_link_icon_txt\"></p>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-4\">\n                    \t<a href=\"/en/certification#si_5\">\n                        <img src=\"/images/CERTIFICATION/icon/img_05.png\" border=\"0\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"\">\n                    \t<p class=\"cf_link_icon_txt\"></p>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-4\">\n                    \t<a href=\"/en/certification#si_6\">\n                        <img src=\"/images/CERTIFICATION/icon/img_06.png\" border=\"0\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"\">\n                    \t<p class=\"cf_link_icon_txt\"></p>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-4\">\n                    \t<a href=\"/en/certification#si_7\">\n                        <img src=\"/images/CERTIFICATION/icon/img_07.png\" border=\"0\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"\">\n                    \t<p class=\"cf_link_icon_txt\"></p>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-4\">\n                    \t<a href=\"/en/certification#si_8\">\n                    \t<img src=\"/images/CERTIFICATION/icon/img_08.png\" border=\"0\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"\">\n                    \t<p class=\"cf_link_icon_txt\"></p>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-4\">\n                    \t<a href=\"/en/certification#si_9\">\n                    \t<img src=\"/images/CERTIFICATION/icon/img_09_2025.png\" border=\"0\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"\">\n                    \t<p class=\"cf_link_icon_txt\"></p>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n             </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"cerfitication_spacing\"></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"cerfitication_spacing\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"cerfitication_spacing\"></div>\n\n    \t<div id=\"cf_area_Asia\" class=\"container cf_area_c\" style=\"\">\n\n                <a name=\"si_1\"></a>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:20px 0 30px 0;\">\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">\n\n            \t<div class=\"cf_img\"><img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/CE.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"Conformity European\"></div>            </div>\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n            \t<div>\n                <img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/ce_b.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive\">                </div>\n            \t<h3 class=\"cf_name\">\n                Conformity European                </h3>\n            \t<div class=\"cf_content\">\n                <p>The Pressure Equipment Directive &nbsp;2014/68/EU(PED) of the EU sets out the standards for the design and fabrication of pressure equipment generally over one liter in volume and having a maximum pressure of more than 0.5 bar gauge. It also sets the administrative procedures requirements for the &quot;conformity assessment&quot; of pressure equipment, for the free placing on the European market without local legislative barriers.<br />\r\nAll of Aquasky Pressure Tank is certified by PED and made by PED certified welder.</p>                </div>\n                <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.certipedia.com/quality_marks/9108658013?locale=en&certificate_number=01+202+TWN%2FQ-19+0360\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-link\">CERTIFICATION LINK</a>    \t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n                <a name=\"si_2\"></a>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:20px 0 30px 0;\">\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">\n\n            \t<div class=\"cf_img\"><img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/NSF58.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"National Sanitation Foundation 58\"></div>            </div>\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n            \t<div>\n                <img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/nsf_b.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive\">                </div>\n            \t<h3 class=\"cf_name\">\n                National Sanitation Foundation 58                </h3>\n            \t<div class=\"cf_content\">\n                <p>NSF/ANSI 58 establishes the minimum requirements for the certification of point-of-use (POU) reverse osmosis systems designed to reduce contaminants that may be present in public or private drinking water.<br />\r\nThe scope of NSF/ANSI 58 includes material safety, structural integrity, total dissolved solids (TDS) reduction, and other optional contaminant reduction claims. The most common optional claims addressed by NSF/ANSI 58 include cyst reduction, hexavalent and trivalent chromium reduction, arsenic reduction, nitrate/nitrite reduction, and cadmium and lead reduction.</p>                </div>\n                <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n                <a href=\"http://info.nsf.org/Certified/DWTU/Listings.asp?Company=12210&Standard=058\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-link\">CERTIFICATION LINK</a>    \t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n                <a name=\"si_3\"></a>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:20px 0 30px 0;\">\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">\n\n            \t<div class=\"cf_img\"><img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/NSF61-20210207.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"National Sanitation Foundation 61\"></div>            </div>\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n            \t<div>\n                <img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/nsf61_b.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive\">                </div>\n            \t<h3 class=\"cf_name\">\n                National Sanitation Foundation 61                </h3>\n            \t<div class=\"cf_content\">\n                <p>NSF/ANSI 61 ensures that your product meets the regulatory requirements for the U.S. and Canada, and it can often meet or fulfill the testing requirements for many other countries as well. Market leaders strive to attain NSF certification as a mark of distinction that provides their customers with assurance that their product is safe for use in drinking water. NSF/ANSI 61 testing covers all products with drinking water contact from source to tap,<br />\r\nand determines what contaminants may migrate or leach from your product into drinking water. It also confirms if they are below the maximum levels allowed to be considered safe.</p>                </div>\n                <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n                <a href=\"https://plm.iapmo.org/pld#/certificate/N-7370/1883\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-link\">CERTIFICATION LINK</a>    \t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n                <a name=\"si_4\"></a>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:20px 0 30px 0;\">\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">\n\n            \t<div class=\"cf_img\"><img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/20241209_EUROCERT-IOS9001.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"Eurocert\"></div>            </div>\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n            \t<div>\n                <img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/eurocert_b.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive\">                </div>\n            \t<h3 class=\"cf_name\">\n                Eurocert                </h3>\n            \t<div class=\"cf_content\">\n                <p>ISO 9001:2015 sets out the criteria for a quality management system and is the only standard in the family that can be certified to (although this is not a requirement). It can be used by any organization, large or small, regardless of its field of activity. This standard is based on a number of quality management principles including a strong customer focus, the motivation and implication of top management, the process approach, and continual improvement.</p>                </div>\n                <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n                <a href=\"/en/certification-page/iso-9001-eurocert\" class=\"btn btn-link\">CERTIFICATION LINK</a>    \t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n                <a name=\"si_5\"></a>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:20px 0 30px 0;\">\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">\n\n            \t<div class=\"cf_img\"><img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/UPC.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"Uniform Plumbing Code (UPC)\"></div>            </div>\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n            \t<div>\n                <img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/upc_b.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive\">                </div>\n            \t<h3 class=\"cf_name\">\n                Uniform Plumbing Code (UPC)                </h3>\n            \t<div class=\"cf_content\">\n                <p>UPC certification mark guarantees the function and safety of Aquasky Pressure Tank. Pre-pressurized potable water tanks with a barrier between the water &amp; air portion of the tank. To be installed in accordance with the manufacturer&#39;s instructions and the requirements&nbsp;of the latest edition of the Uniform Plumbing Code. Products listed on this certificate have been tested by an IAPMO R&amp;T recognized laboratory. This recognition has&nbsp;been granted.</p>                </div>\n                <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n                <a href=\"https://plm.iapmo.org/pld#/certificate/4837/1882\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-link\">CERTIFICATION LINK</a>    \t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n                <a name=\"si_6\"></a>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:20px 0 30px 0;\">\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">\n\n            \t<div class=\"cf_img\"><img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/%E9%9F%93%E6%96%87%E8%AA%8D%E8%AD%89.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"Korea KC Mark Certification\"></div>            </div>\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n            \t<div>\n                <img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/kc_b.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive\">                </div>\n            \t<h3 class=\"cf_name\">\n                Korea KC Mark Certification                </h3>\n            \t<div class=\"cf_content\">\n                <p>The KC (Korea Certification) mark signifies compliance with Korea&#39;s product safety requirements for pressure equipment and is issued by Korea-based certification bodies that have been approved by the Korea Standards Association. Manufacturers and distributors of pressure equipment may apply a KC mark to their goods once they have completed the standard procedure.</p>                </div>\n                <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n                <a href=\"/en/certification-page/kc-korea\" class=\"btn btn-link\">CERTIFICATION LINK</a>    \t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n                <a name=\"si_7\"></a>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:20px 0 30px 0;\">\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">\n\n            \t<div class=\"cf_img\"><img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/20251205_Aquasky%20ACS%20p1.jpg\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"Attestation De Conformité Sanitaire\"></div>            </div>\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n            \t<div>\n                <img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/acs_b.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive\">                </div>\n            \t<h3 class=\"cf_name\">\n                Attestation De Conformité Sanitaire                </h3>\n            \t<div class=\"cf_content\">\n                <p>ACS is the French health certification bodies, chiefly based on AFNOR (Association Francaise de Normalisation) announced standards for Plumbing products testing. Any device or accessory which is in contact with drinking water must be ACS certified in France.&nbsp;</p>                </div>\n                <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n                <a href=\"/en/certification-page/acs-france\" class=\"btn btn-link\">CERTIFICATION LINK</a>    \t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n                <a name=\"si_8\"></a>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:20px 0 30px 0;\">\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">\n\n            \t<div class=\"cf_img\"><img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/20260715_AQUASKY_WRAS_CERTIFICATION.jpg\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"Water Regulations Advisory Scheme\"></div>            </div>\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n            \t<div>\n                <img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/wars_b.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive\">                </div>\n            \t<h3 class=\"cf_name\">\n                Water Regulations Advisory Scheme                </h3>\n            \t<div class=\"cf_content\">\n                <p>WRAS promotes and ensures compliance with the Water Supply (Water Fittings Regulations) in England and Wales, and the equivalent Water Byelaws in Scotland and Northern Ireland.<br />\r\nThe approval system also covers non-metallic components and materials (such as rubber washers and gaskets), which undergo testing to ascertain their effect on the water with which they come into contact.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>                </div>\n                <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n                    \t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n                <a name=\"si_9\"></a>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:20px 0 30px 0;\">\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">\n\n            \t<div class=\"cf_img\"><img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/20251127_WaterMark-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"WaterMark Certification Scheme\"></div>            </div>\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n            \t<div>\n                <img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/2025-WaterMark%20LF(1).png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive\">                </div>\n            \t<h3 class=\"cf_name\">\n                WaterMark Certification Scheme                </h3>\n            \t<div class=\"cf_content\">\n                <p>The WaterMark Certification Scheme is a mandatory certification scheme for plumbing and drainage products.<br />\r\nIt ensures the products comply with the Plumbing Code of Australia, is suitable for use, and meet the relevant Australian Standards relating to product quality, including health and safety.&nbsp; Product with WaterMark Certification Mark on it can be accepted throughout Australia.</p>                </div>\n                <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n                <a href=\"/en/certification-page/watermark-australia\" class=\"btn btn-link\">CERTIFICATION LINK</a>    \t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n                <a name=\"si_10\"></a>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:20px 0 30px 0;\">\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">\n\n            \t<div class=\"cf_img\"><img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/20220802Singapore%20PSB%20certification.jpg\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"PSB certification\"></div>            </div>\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n            \t<div>\n                                </div>\n            \t<h3 class=\"cf_name\">\n                PSB certification                </h3>\n            \t<div class=\"cf_content\">\n                <p>Singapore PSB certification</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Singapore Standards, The Singapore Consumer Product Protection Regulation, was designated in 1911. PSB certification is a mandatory safety certification in Singapore. Only registered products with the SAFETY logo can be sold in Singapore. The relevant units responsible for selling regulated goods to consumers in Singapore must register each model with the security authority.</p>                </div>\n                <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n                <a href=\"/en/certification-page/psb-singapore\" class=\"btn btn-link\">CERTIFICATION LINK</a>    \t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n                <a name=\"si_11\"></a>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:20px 0 30px 0;\">\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">\n\n            \t<div class=\"cf_img\"><img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/20231030_Listing%20Category%20_%20NSF%20372%20International.jpg\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"NSF/ANSI 372 Drinking Water System Components - Lead Content\"></div>            </div>\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n            \t<div>\n                <img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/20231102_AQUASKY_icon_bl-NSF_large.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive\">                </div>\n            \t<h3 class=\"cf_name\">\n                NSF/ANSI 372 Drinking Water System Components - Lead Content                </h3>\n            \t<div class=\"cf_content\">\n                <p>NSF/ANSI 372 establishes limits on the amount of lead that may be present in water contact materials within drinking water system components. This standard specifies that a product must be certified as meeting a weighted average lead content of &le;0.25% when it comes to the wetted surfaces of pipes, pipe fittings, plumbing fittings, and plumbing fixtures. This requirement ensures that these components do not contribute harmful levels of lead to drinking water, helping to protect public health, especially in the context of water used for drinking and cooking.</p>                </div>\n                <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n                <a href=\"https://info.nsf.org/Certified/Lead_Content/Listings.asp?Company=12210&Standard=372-DWTU\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-link\">CERTIFICATION LINK</a>    \t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n            </div>\n\n<div class=\"cerfitication_spacing\"></div>\n</div>"
}
